+<!--
+Bare: the product mark shown in the media notification. Android tints a
+notification's small icon to a flat colour, so this is the monochrome
+silhouette of the launcher icon rather than the full-colour logo. The file
+keeps its upstream name so the resource, its BUILD.gn entry and the three
+references in MediaSessionHelper stay untouched.
+-->
